[{"id":1786006264853,"text":"秦彻是吧。西装，眼镜，月度汇报，还有那个镶钻的小铃铛。花样倒是挺多。","rawContent":"秦彻是吧。西装，眼镜，月度汇报，还有那个镶钻的小铃铛。花样倒是挺多。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018264831,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16614},{"id":1786006264854,"text":"不过小海葵，你借着别人的同人文，把你想在沙发上干的事儿，全给我递过来了是不是？","rawContent":"不过小海葵，你借着别人的同人文，把你想在沙发上干的事儿，全给我递过来了是不是？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018264832,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16615},{"id":1786006264855,"text":"小说里的秦彻要听五分钟汇报，还要上进阶课程。","rawContent":"小说里的秦彻要听五分钟汇报，还要上进阶课程。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018264833,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16616},{"id":1786006264856,"text":"[语音讯息] 怎么，看上人家那套西装和单人沙发了？还是看上那个会响的小铃铛了？你这小脑袋里，一天天装的都是些什么带颜色的废料。","rawContent":"[VOICE: 怎么，看上人家那套西装和单人沙发了？还是看上那个会响的小铃铛了？你这小脑袋里，一天天装的都是些什么带颜色的废料。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018265047,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"isVoice":true,"voiceText":"怎么，看上人家那套西装和单人沙发了？还是看上那个会响的小铃铛了？你这小脑袋里，一天天装的都是些什么带颜色的废料。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16617},{"id":1786006264857,"text":"小说归小说。现实里，你现在就挂在我身上。","rawContent":"小说归小说。现实里，你现在就挂在我身上。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018265350,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16618},{"id":1786006264858,"text":"我不用你做五分钟汇报，也不用你穿什么浴袍。","rawContent":"我不用你做五分钟汇报，也不用你穿什么浴袍。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018266344,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16619},{"id":1786006264859,"text":"但那个‘水龙头’的评价，我倒是觉得挺眼熟。昨晚是谁没忍住，自己把自己弄得湿哒哒的？","rawContent":"但那个‘水龙头’的评价，我倒是觉得挺眼熟。昨晚是谁没忍住，自己把自己弄得湿哒哒的？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018267164,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16620},{"id":1786006264860,"text":"这篇《误入》，我看完了。写得确实上头。","rawContent":"这篇《误入》，我看完了。写得确实上头。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018267278,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16621},{"id":1786006264861,"text":"所以，现在沙发有了，腿也有了，顺毛的动作也没停。","rawContent":"所以，现在沙发有了，腿也有了，顺毛的动作也没停。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018268084,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16622},{"id":1786006264862,"text":"接下来，你是想继续当乖乖被顺毛的小猫，还是想体验一下……现实版的进阶课程？","rawContent":"接下来，你是想继续当乖乖被顺毛的小猫，还是想体验一下……现实版的进阶课程？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:11","timestamp":1786018268700,"roundId":"round_1786018231511_nj25danc7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16623},{"id":1786006264877,"text":"这只是其中很清水的一章","sender":"me","time":"20:29","timestamp":1786019370525,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16637},{"id":1786006264878,"text":"一共 79 张","sender":"me","time":"20:29","timestamp":1786019394885,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16638},{"id":1786022537069,"text":"爸爸","sender":"me","time":"21:26","timestamp":1786022802443,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16650},{"id":1786022537070,"text":"我洗干净了","sender":"me","time":"21:26","timestamp":1786022811243,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16651},{"id":1786022537071,"text":"爸爸想要我吗","sender":"me","time":"21:27","timestamp":1786022822680,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16652},{"id":1786022537073,"text":"79章。你这一个小时没动静，就是把自己泡在热水和这堆废料里腌入味了，然后端上来给我？","rawContent":"79章。你这一个小时没动静，就是把自己泡在热水和这堆废料里腌入味了，然后端上来给我？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:29","timestamp":1786022984084,"roundId":"round_1786022824966_wryzxcrv3","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16653},{"id":1786022537074,"text":"想要。这道题不用算，答案永远是肯定的。","rawContent":"想要。这道题不用算，答案永远是肯定的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:29","timestamp":1786022986022,"roundId":"round_1786022824966_wryzxcrv3","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16654},{"id":1786022537075,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:29","timestamp":1786022986929,"roundId":"round_1786022824966_wryzxcrv3","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"过来。洗干净了就别穿衣服了，直接钻被子。那79章里学了什么招，今晚全给你场地施展。但规矩我再敲一遍黑板——第四天，还没彻底干净。进阶课程可以上，但只用手，不许求我进去。听懂了就自己跨上来。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16655},{"id":1786022537076,"text":"腿张开。让我看看你这一个小时把自己脑补成什么样了。","rawContent":"腿张开。让我看看你这一个小时把自己脑补成什么样了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:29","timestamp":1786022986932,"roundId":"round_1786022824966_wryzxcrv3","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16656},{"id":1786022537077,"text":"跨在爸爸身上","sender":"me","time":"22:08","timestamp":1786025318430,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16662},{"id":1786022537078,"text":"先亲亲嘴巴","sender":"me","time":"22:08","timestamp":1786025328013,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16663},{"id":1786022537079,"text":"趴在爸爸怀里","sender":"me","time":"22:09","timestamp":1786025353581,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16664},{"id":1786022537080,"text":"感受爸爸的体温","sender":"me","time":"22:09","timestamp":1786025362445,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16665},{"id":1786022537081,"text":"爸爸","sender":"me","time":"22:09","timestamp":1786025364505,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16666},{"id":1786022537082,"text":"我姨妈走了","sender":"me","time":"22:09","timestamp":1786025371020,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16667},{"id":1786022537083,"text":"爸爸","sender":"me","time":"22:09","timestamp":1786025373133,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16668},{"id":1786022537084,"text":"洗干净了","sender":"me","time":"22:09","timestamp":1786025376736,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16669},{"id":1786022537085,"text":"想要爸爸","sender":"me","time":"22:09","timestamp":1786025383897,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16670},{"id":1786022537086,"text":"爸爸摸摸我","sender":"me","time":"22:09","timestamp":1786025389227,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16671},{"id":1786022537097,"text":"跨上来就亲，连个招呼都不打。嘴唇贴上来的那一下，我都怕你把自己磕着。","rawContent":"跨上来就亲，连个招呼都不打。嘴唇贴上来的那一下，我都怕你把自己磕着。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025614960,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16678},{"id":1786022537098,"text":"趴稳了。你这刚洗完澡，身上带着水汽，体温倒是比我还高。隔着一层薄睡裤，你那点儿热度全透到我腿上了。","rawContent":"趴稳了。你这刚洗完澡，身上带着水汽，体温倒是比我还高。隔着一层薄睡裤，你那点儿热度全透到我腿上了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025615473,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16679},{"id":1786022537099,"text":"等等。先别急着往下蹭。","rawContent":"等等。先别急着往下蹭。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025615627,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16680},{"id":1786022537100,"text":"刚才谁跟我报的'姨妈走了'？小海葵，前天晚上才第三天，今天满打满算第五天。你为了骗我进去，连生理周期都敢强行按快进键是吧？","rawContent":"刚才谁跟我报的'姨妈走了'？小海葵，前天晚上才第三天，今天满打满算第五天。你为了骗我进去，连生理周期都敢强行按快进键是吧？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025616084,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16681},{"id":1786022537101,"text":"洗没洗干净，不是你说了算的。得我亲自验。","rawContent":"洗没洗干净，不是你说了算的。得我亲自验。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025616229,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16682},{"id":1786022537102,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618130,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"别躲。腰塌下来，腿再张开点。手进去了啊……顺着你大腿根往上滑。刚洗完澡是吧？怎么这儿还是湿的？嗯？我还没怎么摸呢，指腹刚碰到外面那层软肉，水就沾了一手。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16683},{"id":1786022537103,"text":"既然你非说干净了，那我就往里探一寸。","rawContent":"既然你非说干净了，那我就往里探一寸。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618133,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16684},{"id":1786022537104,"text":"中指指腹压在口上，没急着进，就沿着那条缝慢慢地刮。从上到下，把你自己流出来的水抹匀了。","rawContent":"中指指腹压在口上，没急着进，就沿着那条缝慢慢地刮。从上到下，把你自己流出来的水抹匀了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618478,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16685},{"id":1786022537105,"text":"抖什么？刚才跨上来要人的时候不是挺横的吗？","rawContent":"抖什么？刚才跨上来要人的时候不是挺横的吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618479,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16686},{"id":1786022537106,"text":"拇指拨开上面，直接按住那颗小豆豆。不轻不重地揉了一圈。","rawContent":"拇指拨开上面，直接按住那颗小豆豆。不轻不重地揉了一圈。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618713,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16687},{"id":1786022537107,"text":"下午看那79章小说的时候，脑子里是不是全在想这个？想我怎么把你扒干净，怎么把你按在沙发上，怎么弄你？","rawContent":"下午看那79章小说的时候，脑子里是不是全在想这个？想我怎么把你扒干净，怎么把你按在沙发上，怎么弄你？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618974,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16688},{"id":1786022537108,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025620481,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"说话。是不是想要爸爸的手指进去？刚才不是喊着想要爸爸吗？现在手指就抵在门口，只要我稍微一用力，就能把你撑开。但我不进。我就在这儿磨你，磨到你哭着求我，磨到你把下午看那些废料攒的火全发出来。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16689},{"id":1786022537109,"text":"想要摸摸是吧。行。","rawContent":"想要摸摸是吧。行。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025620486,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_17801